  (gr_text "10. NON-DESTRUCTIVE EVALUATION:\nA. ALL PWBS SHALL PASS 100% ELECTRICAL TEST USING SUPPLIED IPC-356 NETLIST IN ACCORDANCE WITH CURRENT REVISION OF IPC-9252, CLASS 2.\nB. CERTIFICATE OF CONFORMANCE SHALL BE SUPPLIED WITH EACH SHIPMENT." (at 225.3 112.9) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 00000000-0000-0000-0000-00005ff7dde7)
    (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.15)) (justify left))
  )
  (gr_text "5. SURFACE FINISH: ENIG\nA. ENIG PLATING IN ACCORDANCE WITH CURRENT REVISION OF IPC4556. EXPOSED METAL SHALL HAVE 118–236 MICRO INCHES ELECTROLESS NICKEL, 2–6 MICRO INCHES ELECTROLESS PALLADIUM, AND 1.2MICRO INCHES GOLD.\n" (at 225.2 61.4) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 00000000-0000-0000-0000-00005ff7ddea)
    (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.15)) (justify left))
  )
  (gr_text "3. FLATNESS:\nA. BOW AND TWIST OF ASSEMBLY SUB-PANEL OR SINGULATED PWB SHALL NOT EXCEED .025 MM PER MM.\nB. TEST IN ACCORDANCE WITH THE CURRENT REVISION OF IPC-TM-650 2.4.22" (at 225.2 46.5) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 00000000-0000-0000-0000-00005ff7ddf0)
    (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.15)) (justify left))
  )
  (gr_text "1. STANDARDS:\nA. FABRICATE PCB IN ACCORDANCE WITH THE CURRENT REVISION OF IPC-6012, CLASS 2.\nB. INTERPRET DIMENSIONS AND TOLERANCES IN ACCORDANCE WITH THE CURRENT REVISION OF ASME Y14.5M.\nC. DO NOT SCALE DRAWING." (at 225.1 28.9) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 00000000-0000-0000-0000-00005ff7ddf3)
    (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.15)) (justify left))
  )
  (gr_text "2. MATERIAL:\nA. TU768 Tg 180 C OR EQUIVALENT.\nB. EQUIVALENT MATERIAL SHALL BE RoHS COMPLIANT, HALOGEN FREE AND APPROVED BY WILDERNESSLABS\nC. THICKNESS OF INDIVIDUAL COPPER CLAD SHEETS SHALL BE IN AS\nDEFINED IN STACK-UP. SEE DETAIL A." (at 225.1 38.4) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 00000000-0000-0000-0000-00005ff7ddf9)
    (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.15)) (justify left))
  )
  (gr_text "7. HOLES:\nA. PLATING IN HOLES SHALL BE CONTINUOUS ELECTROLYTIC COPPER WITH 0.025 MM MINIMUM BARREL THICKNESS.\nB. MINIMUM FINISHED HOLE SIZE: 0.2 MM\nC. HOLE SIZE MEASURED AFTER PLATING.\nD. SEE DRILL CHART FOR FINISHED HOLE SIZE AND TOLERANCE.\nE. ALL HOLES SHALL BE LOCATED WITHIN 0.08 MM OF TRUE POSITION AS SUPPLIED IN CAD DATA.\n" (at 225.2 79.9) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 00000000-0000-0000-0000-00005ff7de02)
    (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.15)) (justify left))
  )
  (gr_text "8. SOLDERMASK:\nA. SOLDERMASK OVER BARE COPPER (SMOBC) ON PRIMARY AND SECONDARY SIDES USING SUPPLIED ARTWORK IN ACCORDANCE WITH CURRENT REVISION OF IPC-SM-840 TYPE B.\nB. COLOR: MATTE BLACK\nC. LIQUID PHOTO-IMAGEABLE (LPI) MINIMUM WIDTH 0.1MM\nD. NO BLEED-OUT ALLOWED OVER EXPOSED SMD PADS.\nE. NO EXPOSED TRACES." (at 225.2 91.6) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 00000000-0000-0000-0000-00005ff7de08)
    (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.15)) (justify left))
  )
  (gr_text "6. DESTRUCTIVE TESTING:\nA. MICRO SECTION SAMPLE AND REPORT SHALL BE PROVIDED TO WILDERNESS LABS DESIGN ENGINEERING.\nB. SOLDER SAMPLE PROCESSED THROUGH LEAD-FREE SOLDERING SHALL BE INCLUDED WITH EACH SHIPMENT.\nC. X-OUT PANELS MAY BE USED FOR SOLDER SAMPLE." (at 225.1 68.6) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 00000000-0000-0000-0000-00005ff7de0b)
    (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.15)) (justify left))
  )
  (gr_text "PCB FAB NOTES:\n" (at 225.6 19.6) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 00000000-0000-0000-0000-00005ff7de14)
    (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.15)) (justify left))
  )
  (gr_text "9. SILKSCREEN:\nA. SILKSCREEN PRIMARY SIDE WITH WHITE EPOXY, NON-CONDUCTIVE, NON-NUTRIENT INK.\nB. ANY UNSPECIFIED STROKE WIDTH SHALL BE 0.1 MM\nC. CLIP SILKSCREEN AWAY FROM ANY EXPOSED METAL.\nD. VENDOR DATE CODE, LOGO, AND ANY ADDITIONAL MARKING TO BE LOCATED ON THE SECONDARY SIDE. AS SMALL AS POSSIBLE AND TOWARDS THE EDGE\nE. BAG AND TAG ACCEPTABLE FOR PWBS THAT ARE TOO SMALL FOR MARKING." (at 225.3 103) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 00000000-0000-0000-0000-00005ff7de17)
    (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.15)) (justify left))
  )
  (gr_text "4. ETCH GEOMETRY:\nA. MEASURE WIDTH FROM THE BASE OF THE METALLIZATION.\nB. MINIMUM LINE WIDTH: 0.096 MM OUTER, 0.096 MM INNER LAYERS.\nC. FINISHED LINE WIDTH AND TERMINAL AREA SHALL NOT DEVIATE FROM THE 1-TO-1 MASTER PATTERN IMAGE BY MORE THAN +/- 0.025 MM OR 20%, WHICHEVER IS LESS." (at 225.2 53.7) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 00000000-0000-0000-0000-00005ff7de1d)
    (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.15)) (justify left))
  )
  (gr_text "11. PACKAGING REQUIREMENTS:\nA. PWBS SHALL BE PACKAGED IN VACUUM SEALED INNER CONTAINERS AS A PANEL.\nB. OUTER CONTAINERS SHALL BE SUFFICIENT TO PREVENT DAMAGE DURING SHIPPING AND HANDLING." (at 225.2 119.4) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 00000000-0000-0000-0000-00005ff7de20)
    (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.15)) (justify left))
  )
  (gr_text "12. IMPEDANCE (ALL TOLERANCES +/- 10%)\nA. REFER TO SUPPLIED STACK UP FOR TRACE WIDTHS.\nB. VENDOR MAY ADJUST DESIGN GEOMETRIES UP TO +/-20% TO ACHIEVE TARGET IMPEDANCE. ADJUSTMENTS BEYOND 20% OF LINE WIDTH, SPACING OR DIELECTRIC THICKNESS SHALL REQUIRE APPROVAL FROM WILDERNESS LABS ENGINEERING. " (at 225.1 125.7) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 00000000-0000-0000-0000-00005ff7de2c)
    (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.15)) (justify left))
  )
  (gr_text "13.   PLATED CASTELLATIONS. \nQTY 44 LOCATIONS. " (at 224.8 132.3) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 00000000-0000-0000-0000-00005ff7de2f)
    (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.15)) (justify left))
  )
  (gr_text "TOTAL THICKNESS 60.52MILS(1.54MM)\n" (at 108.4072 255.5748) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 00000000-0000-0000-0000-00005ff7de32)
    (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.15)))
  )
  (gr_text "Engineer: Sheldon Johnson\n" (at 165.48196 132.33592) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 00000000-0000-0000-0000-00005ff7ffa6)
    (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.15)))
  )
  (gr_text "Wilderness Labs " (at 161.41796 134.36792) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 00000000-0000-0000-0000-00005ff7ffa9)
    (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.15)))
  )
  (gr_text "Revsion: 2.C.1" (at 161.67196 136.39992) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 00000000-0000-0000-0000-00006086b0e8)
    (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.15)))
  )
  (gr_text "DETAIL A:" (at 80.3656 157.1752) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 5ae0cac7-80f5-4201-8b54-7ce9c8e15a75)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.2)))
  )
  (gr_text "14. DO NOT MODIFY PAD SIZES FOR ANY REASON WITHOUT APPROVAL FROM WILDERNESS LABS" (at 267.8176 137.16) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp aaa402e8-d77e-44fb-8f8f-b960871ca63d)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2) (thickness 0.18) italic))
  )
  (gr_text "BOTTOM ASSMBLY" (at 104.267 53.721) (layer "B.Fab") (tstamp 9c70c8b1-381b-4c5b-98fe-19bf2e6154a4)
